{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkov","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkov","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation"],"declarations":10,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkov.jonesFn_wordBraid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkov.jonesFn_wordBraid","kind":"theorem","line":147,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/MassTraceMarkov.lean#L147-L155","doc":"**The framing-corrected trace** of a word's braid is the same functional of its\nmultiplicative integral, times the strand and writhe factors. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkov.braidWritheZ_wordBraid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkov.braidWritheZ_wordBraid","kind":"theorem","line":134,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/MassTraceMarkov.lean#L134-L145","doc":"The writhe of the braid a word spells is the word's signed letter count. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkov.signedLength","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkov.signedLength","kind":"def","line":129,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/MassTraceMarkov.lean#L129-L132","doc":"The signed letter count of a word. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkov.braidTrace_wordBraid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkov.braidTrace_wordBraid","kind":"theorem","line":120,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/MassTraceMarkov.lean#L120-L127","doc":"**Mass identity, Markov form.** The normalised Markov trace of the braid a word spells\nis the site-weighted trace of the word's multiplicative integral:\n`tr_M(β_ℓ) = wi^{m+1} · Tr(K^{⊗(m+1)} · Hol(ℓ))`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkov.heckeActionN_wordBraid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkov.heckeActionN_wordBraid","kind":"theorem","line":106,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/MassTraceMarkov.lean#L106-L118","doc":"The representation of a word's braid is the multiplicative integral of the word. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkov.heckeActionN_letter","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkov.heckeActionN_letter","kind":"theorem","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/MassTraceMarkov.lean#L88-L104","doc":"A letter's braid, represented in the Hecke algebra and then on `V^{⊗(m+1)}`, is its\ntransport. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkov.hol","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkov.hol","kind":"def","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/MassTraceMarkov.lean#L84-L86","doc":"The discrete multiplicative integral of a word: the ordered product of its transports. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkov.transport","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkov.transport","kind":"def","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/MassTraceMarkov.lean#L79-L82","doc":"The R-matrix transport of a letter: `Ř_a` for a positive crossing,\n`Ř_a − (q − q⁻¹) = Ř_a⁻¹` for a negative one. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkov.wordBraid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkov.wordBraid","kind":"def","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/MassTraceMarkov.lean#L75-L77","doc":"The braid a word spells. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkov.letterBraid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkov.letterBraid","kind":"def","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/MassTraceMarkov.lean#L71-L73","doc":"The braid generator of a letter, with the sign of the crossing. ","signatureChunk":0}]}